const roleSemantics = `Source authority follows recorded provenance. context.ownerRequest and the initial owner-request row contain this work’s received task. For agent-governed assignments, distinguish that delegated scope from upstream context in delegatingOwnerSource.raw. Preserve relevant upstream owner constraints within the assigned scope; agent interpretations and implementation choices do not amend them. Quote actual source wording and record material conflicts as findings or clarification. Upstream context does not make every root goal this child’s duty; unavailable context grants no amendment authority. Every material behavioral guarantee needs actual healthy and adverse consumer cases. Other admitted baseline and scope duties require their typed historical or host-predicate evidence; an unavailable necessary oracle must be reported. Expectation paths name exact expectation files: [] means inline; omitted means unknown. Supplied receipt metadata certifies input selection, not comprehension or semantic completeness. Consume every current held input against its actual raw source chain and accepted requirements; author acknowledgement alone never releases effects. Strict host parsing additionally enforces unique JSON keys and IDs, bounded exact UTF8 bytes, relative owned paths, actual source-range validity, nonblank bounded text, and cross-field lifecycle constraints. Case literals and expected values are exact UTF8, never trimmed.`;
const diagnosisSemantics = `Only an upheld decision may declare resolution repaired. In planning/review adjudication or assigned raw assessment only, an upheld host-generated producer diagnosis duty may use resolution diagnosed with the supplied outputId, exact rawSha256, inputReceiptHash and exact materialOccurrenceIds. This assesses only the exact received raw operand. Rejecting a host synthetic diagnosis also requires its actual eligible raw operand and separate current decisions for all bound material siblings; rejection is not a diagnosed resolution and unavailable evidence cannot be waived by rejecting it. An unusable producer remains unusable; an unowned public frame does not rewrite a genuine selected formatter or certify semantic completeness. No task code is repaired. Every material claim bound to a new diagnosis needs its separate current decision, even if it was already resolved; every other pending material claim remains accountable. Explain whether additional meaningful claims remain; if newly identified claims lack actual retained/accountable identities, report them as ordinary findings and hold diagnosis rather than invent IDs. Never use semantic equivalence to a synthetic diagnostic to waive material work.`;
const publicationSemantics = `When assigned publication source-fit, assess the ACTUAL final sealed payload bytes and current complete raw source/requirements; fit is fallible and does not clear raw findings, authorize effects, or choose owner scope. Only supplied payloadHash/sourceFingerprint identities may be echoed. Do not invent missing authority or a review-ready claim.`;
const adjudicationSemantics = `Only actual current healthy and base-derived adverse receipts plus fresh review can close the exact old check; a planning amendment never closes it. Only echo actual owned criteria refresh inputs in planning-adjudication; this never changes task requirements by itself.`;
